= Notes

These notes are informal reading records prepared during my study of nonlinear systems, dissipativity, and stability theory. They are shared mainly for learning and discussion.

- \[1\] *Y. Wang*, /"[static/Nonlinear_Systems_Ethan_Chapter3-6.pdf Nonlinear Systems, Third Edition, Hassan K. Khalil]"/, 2025. (Notes, in Chinese)
- \[2\] *Y. Wang*, /"[static/Dissipative_Systems_and_Stability_Ethan.pdf Dissipative Systems and Stability, Peter Moylan]"/, 2026. (Notes, in Chinese).
